    </array>

    <!--
      Fires every 30 minutes on SUNDAYS and WEDNESDAYS, 8 AM through 10 PM.

      Free-team provisioning profiles last 7 days. Running twice a week means
      the longest gap between refreshes is 4 days, so it takes two whole
      missed days in a row - not one - for the app to expire on a phone.

      The script stamps per-device success (2-day TTL) and skips devices
      already refreshed, so most of these fires are fast no-ops once both
      phones have been reached.
    -->
